A heading slug that starts with any Unicode number takes the s- prefix

```
# ²super

# ١٢٣ heading
.
<section id="s-²super">
  <h1>²super</h1>
</section>
<section id="s-١٢٣-heading">
  <h1>١٢٣ heading</h1>
</section>
```

```
# 1st

# x²
.
<section id="s-1st">
  <h1>1st</h1>
</section>
<section id="x²">
  <h1>x²</h1>
</section>
```
